      "symbol": "Utopia\\Database\\Adapter\\SQL::updateDocuments",
      "description": "The permissions INSERT appends ', ' after every document but the last that has additions, so when a later document is skipped or has none the statement ends in ', ' (a syntax error) after the rows were already updated",
